te":"","overlay_opacity":100,"width":"wide","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20,"padding_left":0,"padding_right":0,"padding_top_mobile":20,"padding_bottom_mobile":20,"padding_left_mobile":0,"padding_right_mobile":0,"spacing_desktop":50,"spacing_mobile":30,"fix_zindex":0}},"recently-viewed":{"type":"section-recently-viewed-products","settings":{"number_of_items":4,"image_ratio":125,"show_in_circle":false,"fill_images":false,"text_alignment":"start","title":"<h2>Recently viewed products<\/h2>","title_underline_style":"none","content_alignment":"center","show_title":true,"show_price":true,"spacing_desktop":80,"spacing_mobile":30,"fix_zindex":0}},"section_faq_VDzTta":{"type":"section-faq","blocks":{"text_dNCcLm":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Do Dreamer RV toppers have CertiPUR-US certification, and what does that mean?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Yes. Every Wanderluxe topper is made with CertiPUR-US certified foam, tested to meet strict standards for emissions, content, performance and durability. That means foam made without formaldehyde, ozone depleters, regulated phthalates, mercury, lead or other heavy metals, with low VOC emissions under 0.5 parts per million, and screened for chemicals linked to cancer or reproductive harm.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_JwmgJC":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"What are Wanderluxe toppers made from?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>A medium-soft density memory foam, made from polyurethane and infused with cooling gel, sitting under a Tencel and polyester blend cover for a soft, breathable feel.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_cbqhGy":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"What's the waterproof protector made from?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>A soft Tencel and polyester blend with a waterproof backing that stays quiet underneath you, built to shield your topper from spills and everyday wear.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_ApJFWy":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Are the protectors noisy?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>No. The waterproof backing is soft and flexible, so there's no crinkling or rustling through the night.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_yfkH9r":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"How thick is the topper?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>50mm, a thickness chosen to add real comfort without adding bulk or unnecessary weight to your van.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_fiJ837":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"How much does the topper weigh?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>It depends on the size, but the Caravan Queen comes in at 7.2kg, kept as light as possible without giving up support.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_7KyKGt":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"I run hot at night, will this topper work for me?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>The cooling gel infused through the memory foam helps regulate temperature, and most of our customers find it keeps them comfortable through the night, though everybody sleeps a little differently.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_EbmtDF":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Can I use an electric blanket with the topper?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Yes, though we recommend placing it on top of the topper rather than underneath, since the anti-slip base isn't designed for that extra heat.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_ide67i":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Will this topper help with a restless partner?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Yes, the memory foam absorbs movement, so you're less likely to feel your partner shifting around beside you.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_tPxA4C":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"I have a folding mattress, will the topper work?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Yes, plenty of customers use ours on folding beds, hybrid setups and camper trailers. Just avoid leaving the foam compressed for long stretches when the van's not in use, store it flat or rolled instead.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_8jfUec":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"I have a bolster-style mattress, will it fit?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Yes, our longer sizes are built with the bolster in mind, and the topper will lift and curve with your bed the same way your sheets do.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_839THf":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Can I use a Wanderluxe topper on my bed at home?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Absolutely. Plenty of customers love theirs so much they've picked up a matching size for home too.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}},"text_EYrLXM":{"type":"text","settings":{"faq_question":"Do you offer custom sizes?","icon":"none","header_image_width":25,"faq_answer":"<p>Not at the moment, but send us your measurements and we'll help you find the closest match from our range.<\/p>","page":"","image_width":465,"liquid":"","html":"","show_contact_form":false}}},"block_order":["text_dNCcLm","text_JwmgJC","text_cbqhGy","text_ApJFWy","text_yfkH9r","text_fiJ837","text_7KyKGt","text_EbmtDF","text_ide67i","text